n- `"#2a2a2a"` (Main.qml toast background)\n- `"white"` (Main.qml toast text, SessionRow.qml unselected)\n- `"gray"` (ChatPanel.qml thinking dots and thinking label)\n- `"#1e1e1e"` (MessageBubble.qml code block background)\n- `"#888888"` (MessageBubble.qml code lang label)\n- `"#d4d4d4"` (MessageBubble.qml code text)\n- `"#33000000"` (MessageBubble.qml attachment fallback)\n- `"red"` (SessionRow.qml selected session)\n- `"magenta"` (CustomRect.qml debug border)\n\nFont sizes:\n- 30 (ChatPanel welcome/greeting, InputField upload button)\n- 22 (InputField send/stop button)\n- 20 (LeftPanel "Agents" header)\n- 16 (LeftPanel "Sessions" header)\n- 11 (MessageBubble code lang label + attachment name)\n- 8 (Attachment compact label)\n\nMy current theme has `fontSm: 11` and `fontXs: 8`, `fontSection: 20`, `fontSubsection: 16`, `fontXl: 30`, `fontLg: 22`. That matches well. Let me also make sure the color tokens are in sync.\n\nLet me rewrite the theme with the rightNow let me update the theme to include exactly the colors from each file (no value changes), then update each QML file.', created_at='Oct 04, 02:48 PM', speaker_name='Amadeus', attachments=()), MessageRow(id=107, session_id=3, role='assistant', text="Now let me update each QML file to reference the theme. I'll do the simple ones first.", created_at='Oct 04, 02:48 PM', speaker_name='Amadeus', attachments=()), MessageRow(id=108, session_id=3, role='assistant', text='Now the remaining files. Let me update them.', created_at='Oct 04, 02:49 PM', speaker_name='Amadeus', attachments=()), MessageRow(id=109, session_id=3, role='assistant', text='Now let me check git status to see everything that changed.', created_at='Oct 04, 02:49 PM', speaker_name='Amadeus', attachments=()), MessageRow(id=110, session_id=3, role='assistant', text='Let me verify the diffs to confirm I only touched colors and font sizes.\n\n', created_at='Oct 04, 02:49 PM', speaker_name='Amadeus', attachments=()), MessageRow(id=111, session_id=3, role='as