ont sizes. Let me first check what the generic module looks like post-revert.', created_at='Oct 04, 02:47 PM', speaker_name='Amadeus', attachments=()), MessageRow(id=105, session_id=3, role='assistant', text='Good, I have the full picture of every hardcoded color and font size. Let me write the slimmed-down theme — **colors and font sizes only, nothing that affects layout or sizing**.', created_at='Oct 04, 02:47 PM', speaker_name='Amadeus', attachments=()), MessageRow(id=106, session_id=3, role='assistant', text='Good. Now let me update the QML files to reference theme colors and font sizes where they\'re currently hardcoded. I\'ll touch each file and be surgical — **no layout, no sizing, no spacing changes**, only replacing color strings and font.pixelSize values with theme references.\n\nLet me go through each file:\n\n1. **`CustomRect.qml`** — `border.color: "magenta"` → `Theme.debugOutline`\n2. **`Main.qml`** — `color: "#c0392b"`, `color: "#2a2a2a"`, `color: "white"`, `duration: 200`, `duration: 150`, `interval: 4000` → colors only (durations stay)\n3. **`ChatPanel.qml`** — `color: "gray"` (x2), `font.pixelSize: 30` (x2) → theme colors and font\n4. **`InputField.qml`** — `font.pixelSize: 30`, `font.pixelSize: 22`\n5. **`MessageBubble.qml`** — `color: "#1e1e1e"`, `color: "#888888"`, `color: "#d4d4d4"`, `color: "#33000000"`, `font.pixelSize: 11` (x2), `font.family: "monospace"`\n6. **`LeftPanel.qml`** — `font.pixelSize: 20`, `font.pixelSize: 16`\n7. **`SessionRow.qml`** — `color: "red"`, `color: "white"`\n8. **`Attachment.qml`** — `font.pixelSize: 8`\n\nLet me also check if `AttachmentPreview.qml` has any colors/fonts. I already read it — no colors or font sizes in it. Same for `InputPanel.qml` — just layout stuff.\n\nLet me also check `Attachment.qml` — I saw `font.pixelSize: 8`, need to check for colors too. It has `radius: 10` (sizing, leave it) and `radius: image.width` — no.\n\nLet me start updating.\n\nActually, wait — I need to check what `"magenta"` resolv